<title>QATAR: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>QATAR GOVERNMENT LIST (970604)</p>
<p> Emir (Ruler)...............Sheikh HAMAD bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Defence)</p>
<p> Crown Prince (heir apparent).........Sheikh JASSIM bin Hamad</p>
<p>						     bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET (Formed 30 Oct 96)</p>
<p> Prime Minister..........Sheikh ABDULLAH bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>(Apptd 29 Oct 96, also Minister of the Interior)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS</p>
<p>Communications, Transport...Sheikh AHMAD bin Nasser al-Thani</p>
<p> Defence.............................................See Emir</p>
<p> Education........................Mohammad Abdel-Rahim KAFOUD</p>
<p> Endowments &amp; Islamic Affairs.........Ahmad Abdullah al-MARRI</p>
<p> Energy &amp; Industry..............Abdullah bin Hamad al-ATTIYAH</p>
<p>Finance, Economy &amp;</p>
<p>     Trade...............Sheikh MOHAMMAD bin Khalifa al-Thani</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs....Sheikh HAMAD bin Jassim bin Jabr al-Thani</p>
<p> Health...........................Abdulrahman Salem al-KAWARI</p>
<p>Housing &amp; Civil Services....Sheikh FALAH bin Jassim al-Thani</p>
<p> Interior..................................See Prime Minister</p>
<p> Justice....................................See Power &amp; Water</p>
<p> Municipal Affairs &amp; Agriculture........Ali Said al-KHIYAREEN</p>
<p> Power &amp; Water..................Ahmad Mohammad Ali al-SUBAI'E</p>
<p>(Also acting Justice Minister)</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS OF STATE</p>
<p>Sheikh MOHAMMAD bin Khaled al-Thani (for Cabinet Affairs)</p>
<p>Ahmad Abdullah al-MAHMOOD (for Foreign Affairs)</p>
<p>Sheikh ABDULLAH bin Khaled al-Thani (for Interior Affairs)</p>
<p>Sheikh AHMAD bin Saif al-Thani</p>
<p>Sheikh HASSAN bin Abdullah bin Mohammad al-Thani</p>
<p>Sheikh HAMAD bin Sahim al-Thani</p>
<p>Sheikh HAMAD bin Abdullah al-Thani</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor.........Abdullah bin Khaled al-ATTIYAH</p>
<p>				  - - - - - - -</p>
